					},
					"range": "3",
					"shots": "3(5)",
					"bulk": "-2",
					"strength": "8",
					"usage": "Cone attack (3 yards)",
					"usage_notes": "No Acc bonus applies and no aiming roll is needed against a target inside the cone (B412): the skill roll is only to avoid intervening obstacles and to keep the cone off friendly targets. Promethium clings to whatever it touches and burns around the edges of hard cover rather than needing a clear line of fire the way a bullet does; treat cover bonuses as halved (round down) against a flame cone, not ignored outright.\n",
